          "sol": "Step 1: Temperature is related to the average kinetic energy of particles.\nStep 2: Heating is energy transfer caused by a temperature difference.\nStep 3: When heating raises the temperature without a change of state, average particle kinetic energy generally increases.\nStep 4: Describe the corresponding movement in the relevant state.",
