          "why": "It measures the energy needed per kilogram for melting, not the energy needed to raise the substance's temperature.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the change from solid to liquid.\nStep 2: State the mass used in the definition.\nStep 3: Explain what happens to temperature during the change of state.\nStep 4: Give the SI unit.",
          "hint": "Include the mass, change of state and temperature condition.",
          "subject": "chemistry",
          "chapter": "energy_rate_reaction",
          "topic": "Latent Heat of Fusion",
          "conceptId": "chemistry_energy_rate_reaction_latent_heat_of_fusion",
          "skillId": "chemistry_energy_rate_reaction",
          "subskillId": "chemistry_energy_rate_reaction_q1"
