      "notes": "<h2>Test for Chlorine</h2>\n\n  <p>Chlorine gas is represented by <strong>Cl₂</strong>.</p>\n\n  <h3>Properties useful for identification</h3>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li>Chlorine is a greenish-yellow gas.</li>\n    <li>It has a choking smell.</li>\n    <li>It is toxic.</li>\n    <li>It has bleaching properties when moisture is present.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>Test</h3>\n\n  <p>Expose damp blue litmus paper to the gas.</p>\n\n  <h3>Positive result</h3>\n\n  <p>The blue litmus paper is first turned red and then <strong>bleached</strong>.</p>\n\n  <p>The bleaching occurs because chlorine reacts with water to form substances that can oxidise coloured materials.</p>",
